+        Parameters
+        ==========
+        accessions : Tuple[str, ...]
+            The accessions of the element, each once, in KGML order ('_get_entry_kegg_ids').
+
+        layer : dict
+            A sliced layer model of numeric or categorical values ('_build_slice_model').
+
+        context : Union[str, None]
